17:37.310 --> 17:38.750
"Viva Music"

17:49.959 --> 17:51.129
"Viva Music, Alat Musik, Perbaikan, Pelajaran Musik"

18:06.879 --> 18:08.240
- Hei, aku mati!
- Aku mau mati!

18:08.240 --> 18:09.909
